  "id": "block-hash-v2",
  "text": "Start at the first Base block whose timestamp is after editAt, the time of the skill's edit. In each block the one candidate is the transaction at index (the block's hash as an integer) modulo (the block's transaction count). For each needed type in order, scanning forward from the block after the previous pick, take the first candidate whose chain-derived answer has that type and at most 4 token movements, and whose receipt has no Transfer log the chain reader does not count (an NFT's). A reverted transaction has the type reverted; any other has its action, and a swap fits only when the sender sent one token and received another. A block whose candidate does not fit is skipped and counted. A type not found within maxScan blocks is listed as not found, and the next type starts where that scan began."
 },
